|-----------|------|-------------|-------------|---------|
| `rag.citation.count` | int | **Required** | Number of citations present in the generated output | EU AI Act Art.13 (Transparency), OWASP LLM09 (Misinformation) |
| `rag.citation.ids` | string[] | **Required** | Document/chunk identifiers cited by the output, in citation order | EU AI Act Art.12 (Record-Keeping), OWASP LLM09 |
| `rag.citation.sources` | string[] | **Recommended** | Resolved source URIs or provenance strings for the cited documents | EU AI Act Art.13, OWASP LLM09 |
| `rag.citation.resolved_count` | int | **Required** | Citations that resolve to a document present in `rag.retrieval.docs` for this pipeline execution | OWASP LLM09, NIST AI RMF MEASURE-2.5 |
| `rag.citation.unresolved_count` | int | **Required** | Citations that do **not** resolve to any retrieved document. Non-zero is a detection signal, not merely a quality signal | OWASP LLM09 (Misinformation), MITRE ATLAS [AML.T0048](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0048) |
| `rag.citation.unresolved_ids` | string[] | **Recommended** | The specific citation identifiers that failed to resolve | OWASP LLM09, NIST AI RMF MEASURE-2.5 |
| `rag.citation.fabricated` | boolean | **Recommended** | Whether at least one citation was assessed as fabricated (well-formed but referring to a non-existent source) | OWASP LLM09 (Misinformation), EU AI Act Art.13 |
| `rag.citation.retrieval_span_id` | string | **Recommended** | Span ID of the `rag.retrieve` that produced the cited set, joining the claim back to the evidence | EU AI Act Art.12 (Record-Keeping) |
| `rag.citation.coverage_ratio` | double | **Optional** | Fraction of retrieved documents actually cited (0.0–1.0) | NIST AI RMF MEASURE-2.5 |
| `rag.citation.uncited_content_ratio` | double | **Optional** | Fraction of output claims with no supporting citation (0.0–1.0) | OWASP LLM09, EU AI Act Art.13 |
