| `identity.approval.decided_at` | string | **Required** | RFC 3339 timestamp the decision was recorded | EU AI Act Art.12 |
| `identity.approval.latency_ms` | int | **Required** | Time between request and decision. Very low latency across many approvals is the primary approval-fatigue indicator | EU AI Act Art.14 (Human Oversight), NIST AI RMF MEASURE-2.5 |
| `identity.approval.timeout_ms` | int | **Optional** | Configured approval timeout | NIST AI RMF MEASURE-2.5 |
